blake2-kat.json
    The BLAKE2 known-answer tests, testvectors/blake2-kat.json of https://github.com/BLAKE2/BLAKE2.
    Downloaded from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BLAKE2/BLAKE2/master/testvectors/blake2-kat.json on 2026-10-24.
    License: CC0 1.0 Universal (the BLAKE2 reference code and test vectors are dedicated to the public domain).
    Used: every entry: BLAKE2b, BLAKE2s, BLAKE2bp, BLAKE2sp, BLAKE2Xb and BLAKE2Xs, unkeyed and keyed
    (inputs 0 to 255 bytes; keys 0x00..0x3f for the b variants and 0x00..0x1f for the s variants).

